# LF in every checkout, whatever core.autocrlf says (unified/src/cli/README.md, Line endings): Godot, odinfmt and uni
# all write LF, and `uni fmt --check` fails on CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf
# The one exception: cmd.exe misreads labels and goto in a batch file with LF line endings.
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
# Read byte for byte: exported levels and reference runs.
*.level binary
simulation/tests/testdata/*.log binary
simulation/tests/testdata/*.snap binary
# Art, byte for byte: a pack's files stay exactly what it ships (some have CRLF line endings); Godot's .import files
# beside them are ours, LF like the rest.
assets/** -text
assets/**/*.import text eol=lf
*.glb binary
*.png binary
